{
  "title": "Juicy Sour Polish Duck Skewers",
  "description": "A traditional Polish dish with a sour twist, featuring soda water and infuse oil, perfect for a date night. This recipe is also ayurvedic-rajasic-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Polish",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
